# The photo set of every dataset. 491 MB of pictures. It does not belong in git.
workbench/dataset/*/photo/

# A deleted photo is moved here, not unlinked. The directory holds pictures, so
# it does not belong in git either.
workbench/dataset/*/trash/

# The work directory: the state database, the raw downloads, the logs, the trash.
# Every file here is rebuilt by the pipeline.
workbench/work/

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Backups and temporary files
*.bak
*.tmp

.DS_Store

# One directory per match run. `scripts/match_run.py` writes it. The output is
# rebuilt by a new run and does not belong in git. On 2026-09-29 the four runs of
# BENCHMARKS.md were added with `git add -f`, without `results.jsonl`. Their
# `queries.jsonl` keeps the label snapshot of 2026-09-27.
workbench/runs/
workbench/dataset/*/runs/

# The artifact folder of a report: images, raw JSON, logs, vectors. On 2026-09-27 three
# such folders held about 1.4 GB. The owner asked to keep them out of git. The report
# `.md` file next to a folder stays in git. On 2026-09-29 the `.md` files inside the
# folders and the small JSON files that they link were added with `git add -f`.
/workbench/docs/reports/*/

# The lock file next to a shared JSON file. `scripts/cluster_rules.py` makes it
# to serialise writes. It holds no data.
*.lock

# The lab data (plan 75): the catalogue `data/catalog/`, the test data `data/testsets/`,
# the caches `data/cache/`, and the database copies `data/backups/`. The owner asked on
# 2026-09-24 to keep the whole directory out of git. The leading slash limits the rule to
# the project root, so `tests/data/` stays in git.
# The history of the database is in git as the text export `db-export/`. The skill
# backup-lab-db writes it. Read docs/plans/50_lab-db-text-export.md.
# On 2026-09-26 the owner asked to put the main photos, the patches, and the alternative
# photos in git, and to keep the caches out. git cannot take back a file of an ignored
# directory, so the rules ignore the content of `data/`, of `data/catalog/`, and of
# `data/catalog/images/`, not the directories.
/workbench/data/*
!/workbench/data/catalog/
/workbench/data/catalog/*
!/workbench/data/catalog/images/
/workbench/data/catalog/images/*
!/workbench/data/catalog/images/main/
!/workbench/data/catalog/images/patched/
!/workbench/data/catalog/images/additional/
# On 2026-09-29 the owner asked to put into git all data that cannot be rebuilt. So the
# test photos `data/testsets/images/` are in git too. `clusters.json` and
# `cluster-rules.json` of the embedding gx10-siglip2-so400m-patch16-naflex-p512 were added
# with `git add -f`: VLM answers and reviewer notes made them. SAM3 and SigLIP2 rebuild
# the cuts, the vectors, and the prepared PNG files, so these stay out of git.
!/workbench/data/testsets/
/workbench/data/testsets/*
!/workbench/data/testsets/images/
